<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Monday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat 2-Monica Seles (U.S.) 0-6 6-4 8-6</p>
<p>Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) beat Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland)</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>11-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn</p>
<p>(Thailand) 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
